**Attention mechanism** is a algorithm to solve the problem of sequence-to-sequence. 
*FAQ part 11, Attention seq2seq homework*

Attention mechanism is a algorithm to tackle the long seqeuence problem. Instead of directly modeling the long sequence with recurrent neural network (RNN) or Long Short Term Memory recurrent neural network (LSTM recurrent neural network), the attention mechanism uses the attention weight(calculate with some method) to decide that the network needs to pay more attention to what parts of the input sequences or needs to learn more information from them.

Traditional RNN and LSTM require to save all the information they received in the past. which is too expensive to store them for long the sequence. But when using attention mechanism, because of the attention weight decide that the network needs to pay more attention to some certain parts of the sequence, it does not need to take care of the other unimportant parts, it only need to save the information from the parts which the attention weight is not zero, this clear the memory of the network and make the network work very well on the task which needs the context of long sequence.
