   :width: 600px
   :alt: A plot of token attention scores for DistilBERT

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The model adapts to the inputs provided, updating the outputted heatmaps for visual exploration. This is just the attention heatmap visualization, which is only one way to interpret the attention scores for a model. There's always more context to consider, but this is a great starting point to understanding the attention mechanism. Can you notice which parts of the sentence receive the most attention with analyzing the attention heatmaps?

