Music LSTM is a system created using TensorFlow to develop music generation either through training it with a pre-existing dataset or through a manual approach. The first case is lovely because it can learn fascinating styles that could be later used to generate the music. The second case is also fantastic because it enables creativity.

Nevertheless, the central point is how we are going to develop this system so that we can replicate it using the distributed training technique.

The Music LSTM system is created with TensorFlow using an LSTM layer, with the primary purpose of training this model on a dataset and using to generate new music pieces.

