## Answer (1)

#### Benchmarking inference performance can be as simple as just measuring API elapsed time.

> knowing how you can do a request to your server with a benchmark/포괄적인 테스트 of large number of images.

You should have your server implement some utility routes that help you test it. All HTTP requests have timing in them, so all you have to do is look at the time. The simplest HTTP client is `curl`, which is available on *all systems* (including Windows 10 builds by now) and requires *no setup*.

